@startuml Deployment - Context & Infrastructure
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFF
skinparam handwritten false
title ksf_stockmarket System Deployment / Context View\nBABOK: Strategy Analysis, Information Management | PMBOK: Project Scope Management

node "Web Server\n(PHP App)" {
  component [Frontend\nDashboard]
}

node "API Server\n(Python API)" {
  component [REST API]
  component [Runner\n(Cron)]
  component [Backtester]
}

node "Database Server" {
  database [MariaDB\nPortfolios &\nTransactions]
}

node "Advisors" {
  component [Advisor Engine]
  component [Notifier]
  component [Strategy\nEvaluator]
}

node "External\nSystems" {
  component [SMTP/\nWhatsApp/Discord]
  component [Market Data\nFeed]
}

node "Users" {
  component [Investors]
}

' Interaction flows
[Frontend Dashboard] --> [REST API] : HTTPS
[REST API] --> [MariaDB Portfolios & Transactions] : TCP/3306
[Runner (Cron)] --> [Advisor Engine] : Process
[Advisor Engine] --> [Strategy Evaluator] : Rules
[Advisor Engine] --> [Notifier] : Recommendations
[Notifier] --> [SMTP/WhatsApp/Discord] : Push
[Backtester] --> [MariaDB Portfolios & Transactions] : Read-only

[Market Data Feed] --> [REST API] : Live prices
[Market Data Feed] --> [Backtester] : Historical data

[Investors] --> [Frontend Dashboard] : Browser
[Investors] --> [Advisor Engine] : Manual query

@enduml
